{"id":"c5f66824067fc015","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element.md","title":"ZFC Poset Zorn Maximal Element","display":"df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element — ZFC Poset Zorn Maximal Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element — ZFC Poset Zorn Maximal Element","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-zorn-maximal-element — ZFC Poset Zorn Maximal Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> (poset order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in P\">\\(m\\in P\\)</span> (maximal-element candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetZornMaximalElement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetZornMaximalElement}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}element} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetZornMaximalElement}_S(m,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\land m\\in P\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle m,x\\rangle\\in\\leq\\to x=m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}element} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetZornMaximalElement}_S(m,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\land m\\in P\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle m,x\\rangle\\in\\leq\\to x=m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ (pose